OL,3,GNEWSAMum denies killing son in attack
OL,4,Aat their home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother has pleaded not guilty to
OL,7,Fkilling her son by manslaughter, having
OL,8,Falready denied murdering him.
OL,10,FIrene Webb, 51, is accused of carrying
OL,11,Fout the attack at the block of flats
OL,12,Fthey lived at in Norman Crescent,
OL,13,FBrentwood, on 19 October 2025.
OL,15,FSeveral calls had been made to Essex
OL,16,FPolice about Roman-Vien Klimas' welfare
OL,17,Fthat evening, prompting officers to
OL,18,Fvisit and subsequently find his body.
OL,20,FAppearing at Basildon Crown Court via a
OL,21,Fvideo link, Webb was told she would
OL,22,Fstand trial on 7 June 2027.
